OL,3,AMore than 600 killed in flash floods on
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border as rain complicates
OL,5,Arescue efforts
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 600 people have died
OL,8,Ffollowing Wednesday's devastating flash
OL,9,Fflood in Nepal
OL,11,FAt least 2,426 people are missing,
OL,12,FNepal's disaster management authority
OL,13,Fsays as rescue operations continue for
OL,14,Fthe fourth day
OL,16,FFamilies of the missing - including at
OL,17,Fleast 517 foreign nationals - are
OL,18,Fwaiting for news on the whereabouts of
OL,19,Ftheir loved ones
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
